================================================================================
AGPL NOTICE — PyMuPDF
================================================================================

PyMuPDF is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3
(AGPL-3.0).

PyMuPDF is used ONLY by the optional "pdf" extra declared in pyproject.toml
(project.optional-dependencies.pdf), and only by the PDF extraction path in
research/pdf. It is NOT imported by the core library, NOT required to install
or run the backtesting engine, NOT required for the CLI, and NOT required for
the Streamlit UI.

Install it only if you intend to use the PDF extraction path and can comply
with AGPL-3.0, including the network-use source-availability obligation in
section 13 of that licence.

The default Docker image (docker/Dockerfile without --build-arg UV_EXTRA=pdf)
does NOT contain PyMuPDF. The "pdf" Compose profile
(docker/compose.yaml, --profile pdf) builds an image that DOES contain it; treat
that image as an AGPL-3.0 combined work.

